    "methods_description": "EEG was recorded at 1000 Hz, referenced to Cz, with a 128-channel HydroCel Geodesic Sensor Net (Electrical Geodesics), keeping impedances below 50 kilohms. Infants watched up to 15 minutes of relaxing videos with sound (ten 90-second videos separated by breaks), each preceded by a three-second attention grabber. Stimuli were presented with E-Prime. Caregivers were instructed to sit silently and could redirect the infant's attention only by pointing to the screen.",
